<title>HONG KONG: HK observatory reports Japan quake.</title>
<headline>HK observatory reports Japan quake.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>A severe earthquake estimated at 6.6 on the Richter scale was detected 920 km (570 miles) south of Tokyo early on Thursday, the Royal Hong Kong Observatory said.</p>
<p>The observatory said the quake, recorded at 0407 local time (2007 GMT Wednesday), was located in the vicinity of Bonin Islands.</p>
